  "meaning": "Suppose every actual root gives by total optimal output with at most one optimal candidate (so each gives being to exactly one being per accessible world where it exists). The common GOD_4 root n of 0c27f65a (only its root and reach clauses are used) is an actual root. By #1947's law 2 (a conjunct of its premise-free certificate b8ee1a50), from (b1), factive giving, the common root, necessary roots and some concrete contingent being, n is two-way toward some concrete contingent c: it gives c being at w and not at some accessible world v where it exists. By the first conjunct of #1737's certificate (1822b59d), total optimal output with a unique optimum gives cross-world stable output on n's giving-output profile, which is being fixed toward every being given at w (law 1); so n gives c being at v: contradiction. Constructive.",
